// Constants drop the VK_ prefix (vk.FORMAT_R8G8B8A8_UNORM), so they cannot
// collide with the enumerators the header declares. Structs keep their C names,
// which @c_import resolves against <vulkan/vulkan.h>: the header is the layout.
//
// Commands are reached through the loader contrib/vulkan opens at runtime,
// never linked, so a program starts where there is no Vulkan. Each resolves on
// first call to the loader's exported entry point (every core and window-system
// command); vk.load_instance(instance) and vk.load_device(device) switch them to
// that instance's and device's own entry points, which is also how an extension
// command the loader does not export is reached. With no loader a command that
// returns a VkResult returns ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED, others 0 or null.
//
// A command that fills an array another parameter counts also has a <command>_all
// making both calls: devices, n, r = vk.vkEnumeratePhysicalDevices_all(instance).

